You appear to be sending your emails to lojban-beginners@lojban.org

If you want to unsubscribe, don't send them there.

To unsubscribe from this list, send mail to lojban-list-request@lojban.org

Have as the subject the single word "unsubscribe" (without the quotation 
marks.)  For some reason you had a forward slash in your subject line.

Hope that helps.  If it works I'd appreciate a quick email to tell me so.  If 
it doesn't, send mail to secretary@lojban.org for help.


